I am standing on the crowded street.
I do not see the sea.
I am lost.
I look all around.
There is a small shop nearby.
An elderly man is sitting at the shop.
I go near him.
I say, "Hello, chacha."
"Which is the way to Marine Drive?"
Chacha smiles.
He says, "Hello madam, the way is very easy."
"You go straight from here."
"Turn right from the next corner."
"Then walk straight."
"Go towards the sea."
"Marine Drive is right ahead."
I become happy.
I say, "Thank you very much, chacha."
Chacha says, "Go safely."
I walk towards the next corner.
